<div class="mv5">
<div class="st-ad">Advertisement · from {{ brand }}</div>
  <article class="st"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="kick">Midlife · Daily routine</p>
    <h1>Why we made a supplement that only says what&#39;s proven</h1>
    <div class="by"><span class="av">{{ brand | slice: 0 }}</span><span>The {{ brand }} team · 4 min read</span></div>
    <div class="photo">{%- if section.settings.hero_image != blank -%}{{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: alt: section.settings.hero_image.alt, loading: 'eager' }}{%- endif -%}</div>
    <p>If you&#39;re in your late forties or fifties, there&#39;s a good chance your kitchen cupboard looks a bit like ours used to. <b>A tub of powder you used twice. A bottle of tablets the size of your thumb. Something a friend swore by.</b></p>
    <p>And every week, a new advert promising to fix everything.</p>
    <p class="pull">We wanted something simple, honest and easy to keep up.</p>
    <h2>The problem with the supplement shelf</h2>
    <p>Most women we know aren&#39;t short of supplements. <b>They&#39;re short of ones they actually keep taking.</b> Big tablets are hard to swallow. Powders need mixing. And after a couple of weeks, the tub quietly moves to the back of the cupboard.</p>
    <p>Then there are the claims. Online, it can feel like every product promises to fix everything. In the UK, <b>food supplements are only allowed to make health claims that have been scientifically assessed and authorised.</b> Anything else is just marketing.</p>
    <div class="photo">{%- if section.settings.macro_image != blank -%}{{ section.settings.macro_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: alt: section.settings.macro_image.alt, loading: 'lazy' }}{%- endif -%}</div>
    <h2>So we started with one mineral</h2>
    <p>Magnesium is one of the few nutrients with a clear list of authorised claims. It&#39;s simple, well understood, and <b>each {{ brand }} gummy holds 90mg of it.</b></p>
    <ul class="cl">
      <li class="ck">Magnesium contributes to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue</li>
      <li class="ck">Magnesium contributes to normal psychological function</li>
      <li class="ck">Magnesium contributes to normal functioning of the nervous system</li>
      <li class="ck">Magnesium contributes to normal muscle function</li>
      <li class="ck">Magnesium contributes to the maintenance of normal bones</li>
    </ul>
    <p><b>Those five claims are everything we say about it, word for word.</b></p>
    <a class="btn cbtn" href="/cart/{{ v2.id }}:1">See today&#39;s price →</a><p class="cnote">First-jar guarantee · Free UK delivery on 2+ jars · No subscription</p>
    <h2>Then we made it something you&#39;d look forward to</h2>
    <p>A supplement only works if you take it, so we made {{ brand }} a <b>soft berry gummy that tastes like ripe red berries.</b> You chew it straight from the jar, and it never tastes chalky. Vegan, gelatine-free and made without the 14 major allergens.</p>
    <div class="photo">{%- if section.settings.take_image != blank -%}{{ section.settings.take_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: alt: section.settings.take_image.alt, loading: 'lazy' }}{%- endif -%}</div>
    <h2>How women use it</h2>
    <ol class="steps2"><li>Keep the jar by the kettle, where you&#39;ll see it every morning.</li><li>Chew two gummies with your morning tea. It takes about ten seconds.</li><li>Give it a full {{ n }} days as part of your routine, then notice how your days feel.</li></ol>
    <h2>You have two options</h2>
    <div class="opt2"><div class="o1"><b>Option 1</b><p>Keep things as they are. The tubs stay in the cupboard and nothing changes.</p></div><div class="o2"><b>Option 2</b><p>Try {{ brand }} for {{ n }} days. Finish your first jar. If it isn&#39;t for you, email us within 45 days of delivery and we&#39;ll refund it. <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/refunds">Full terms</a>.</p></div></div>
    <p>There&#39;s no subscription and nothing renews. <b>The only thing you need to decide is which pack to start with.</b></p>
  </div></article>
  <section class="lp-offer" id="offer"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="kit"><div class="kit-img">{%- if section.settings.jar_image != blank -%}{{ section.settings.jar_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: alt: section.settings.jar_image.alt, loading: 'lazy' }}{%- endif -%}</div><h2>Get started with {{ brand }}</h2>
      <ul class="kit-list"><li class="ck">{{ n | times: 2 }} berry gummies in every jar, 90mg magnesium each</li><li class="ck">A daily habit that takes less than a minute</li><li class="ck">UK-authorised claims only, vegan and gelatine-free</li><li class="ck">Free UK delivery on 2 or more jars</li><li class="ck">Backed by our first-jar guarantee</li></ul></div>
    <div class="packs2">
      <a class="pk2" href="/cart/{{ v1.id }}:1"><span class="go" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="t"><b>1 jar</b><span class="sup">{{ n }}-day supply</span></span><span class="p"><b>{{ v1.price | money }}</b><small>~{{ pd1 | money }} a day</small></span><span class="extra"><span class="ln"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/></svg>UK delivery {{ section.settings.single_delivery }}</span><span class="ln"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg>First-jar guarantee</span></span></a>
      <a class="pk2 best" href="/cart/{{ v2.id }}:1"><span class="go" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="t"><b>2 jars</b><span class="tag">Most popular</span><span class="sup">{{ n | times: 2 }}-day supply</span></span><span class="p"><b>{{ v2.price | money }}</b><small>~{{ pd2 | money }} a day</small></span><span class="extra"><span class="savepill">Save {{ sv2 | money }} vs 2 single jars</span><span class="ln fs"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/></svg>FREE UK delivery included</span><span class="ln"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg>First-jar guarantee</span></span></a>
      <a class="pk2" href="/cart/{{ v3.id }}:1"><span class="go" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="t"><b>3 jars</b><span class="tag">Best price</span><span class="sup">{{ n | times: 3 }}-day supply</span></span><span class="p"><b>{{ v3.price | money }}</b><small>~{{ pd3 | money }} a day</small></span><span class="extra"><span class="savepill">Save {{ sv3 | money }} vs 3 single jars</span><span class="ln fs"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/></svg>FREE UK delivery included</span><span class="ln"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg>First-jar guarantee</span></span></a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn cta" href="/cart/{{ v2.id }}:1">Get 2 jars for {{ v2.price | money }} →</a>
    <div class="perks"><span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.6"/></svg>Free UK delivery on 2+ jars ({{ section.settings.single_delivery }} for one jar)</span><span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg>Backed by our first-jar guarantee</span><span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0114-5.3L20 9"/><path d="M20 4v5h-5"/><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 01-14 5.3L4 15"/><path d="M4 20v-5h5"/></svg>One-off purchase. No subscription, nothing renews.</span></div>
    <p style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:6px">This page is an advertisement from {{ brand }}. Food supplements should not be used as a substitute for a varied, balanced diet and a healthy lifestyle. If you take medication, are pregnant or breastfeeding, speak to your GP before use.</p>
  </div></section>
  <div class="lp-sbar"><div><b>2 jars · {{ v2.price | money }}</b><small>Free UK delivery · First-jar guarantee</small></div><a class="btn" href="/cart/{{ v2.id }}:1">See price</a></div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mëva story advertorial",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_name", "label": "Brand name", "default": "Mëva" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "product_handle", "label": "Product handle", "default": "meva-magnesium-gummies" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "jar_count", "label": "Days per jar (60 gummies at 2 a day)", "default": 30 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "guarantee_days", "label": "Guarantee days", "default": "30" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "single_delivery", "label": "Delivery price for 1 jar", "default": "£4.99" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_image", "label": "Top image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "macro_image", "label": "Image 2" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "take_image", "label": "Image 3" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "jar_image", "label": "Offer image" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Mëva story advertorial" }]
}
{% endschema %}
